="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a-instructor" parent="1" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#E8EEF9;strokeColor=#2E7D32;fontColor=#2E7D32;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;Instructor&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="745.0" width="60" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#7F6000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;size=14;" value="&lt;b&gt;Luồng 09 — Theo dõi tiến độ &amp;amp; chứng chỉ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 10 use case: UC-P01, UC-P02, UC-P03, UC-P05, UC-P06, UC-P07, UC-P08, UC-P09, UC-P10, UC-P11&lt;br&gt;• Nét liền = association actor ↔ use case. Nét đứt vàng = «include» (bắt buộc) / «extend» (có điều kiện).&lt;br&gt;• Ellipse &lt;b&gt;vàng&lt;/b&gt; = use case thuộc &lt;b&gt;Key Challenge&lt;/b&gt; (UC-P01, UC-P02, UC-P07, UC-P10)&lt;br&gt;• «include»: UC-P02 và UC-P10 → UC-P07 (tính lại % hoàn thành). UC-P04 (nộp quiz) vẽ chi tiết ở luồng 05.&lt;br&gt;• Sơ đồ tổng quan &amp;amp; ma trận role: &lt;i&gt;../uc-overview.drawio&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;../uc-overview-by-role.drawio&lt;/i&gt;." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="982" width="960" height="132" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>